  "subtitle": "Capture room headcount, care transition, observed condition, and immediate comfort; confirm guardian notice and center review.",
  "description": "Childcare Incident records room headcount, care transition, observed condition, immediate comfort, guardian notice, and center review. Childcare Incident evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this childcare incident time-ordered tracking when staff must document room headcount and care transition. Reconcile observed condition, immediate comfort, guardian notice, and center review before the childcare incident handoff. Use the room attendance sheet, staffing ratio record, care-transition timestamp, objective observation, first-aid supply record, guardian call log, and director review. Ask the assigned childcare incident reviewer to confirm room headcount against the organization's policy.",
